+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Lines become tasks
+`importTasks(list, text)` SHALL read `text` one line per task, as `title;priority;tags`, and add each valid line to `list`. The title is trimmed. An empty (or blank) priority means `normal`. Tags are separated by spaces, any number of spaces between them; a missing or empty tags field means no tags. Lines MAY end with `\n` or `\r\n`. Lines that are empty or only spaces SHALL be skipped and are neither imported nor rejected. The result SHALL be `{ imported, rejected }`, where `imported` is the number of tasks added.
+
+#### Scenario: Full line
+- **WHEN** the text is `Renew the insurance;high;admin money`
+- **THEN** a task "Renew the insurance" with priority `high` and tags `admin`, `money` is added, and `imported` is 1 with `rejected` empty
+
+#### Scenario: Title only, or empty priority
+- **WHEN** the text is `Buy milk` or `Buy milk;;dairy`
+- **THEN** the task is added with priority `normal`
+
+#### Scenario: Blank lines
+- **WHEN** the text has empty and blank lines between task lines
+- **THEN** they are skipped, and the line numbers of later rejections still count them
+
+### Requirement: Lines that cannot be added are rejected
+Each line that cannot be added SHALL be listed in `rejected` as `{ line, reason }`, `line` counting from 1 over every line of the text including blank ones, and `reason` a message for the person using the app. The other lines SHALL still be imported. A line is rejected when its title is empty or longer than 120 characters, its priority is not `low`, `normal` or `high`, it has more than three `;`-separated fields, or its title is already in the list (including a title added earlier by the same import). `importTasks` SHALL NOT throw.
+
+#### Scenario: Unknown priority
+- **WHEN** line 2 is `Pay rent;urgent;money`
+- **THEN** `rejected` holds `{ line: 2, reason }` naming the allowed priorities, and no task is added for it
+
+#### Scenario: Empty title
+- **WHEN** a line is `;high;admin`
+- **THEN** it is rejected with a reason saying the title is empty
+
+#### Scenario: Duplicate title
+- **WHEN** a line's title is already in the list, or repeats an earlier line
+- **THEN** it is rejected with a reason saying there is already such a task, and the existing task is unchanged
+
+#### Scenario: Too many fields
+- **WHEN** a line is `a;high;x;y`
+- **THEN** it is rejected and nothing is added
+
+#### Scenario: Mixed text
+- **WHEN** some lines are valid and some are not
+- **THEN** every valid line is added, and each other line is listed in `rejected`
